english.txt is BIP-39's English word list, unchanged from
https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/ce1862ac6bcffa1dd20aad858380e51e66e949ea/bip-0039/english.txt
and identical at 0d1b892ddb21c22def4af4541bfed7a2a3480e4a, whose bip-0039.mediawiki reads
"License: MIT" and "This BIP falls under the MIT License."

